<title>JAPAN: Foreigners yen bond buying at record high in Oct.</title>
<headline>Foreigners yen bond buying at record high in Oct.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners' net purchases of yen bonds in October totalled a record 3.1288 trillion yen, the Japan Securities Dealers' Association (JSDA) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The previous record high was 2.9712 trillion yen in May 1996.</p>
</text>
